    "summary": "A psychic level 1 ability. During a [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), once this unit has been **selected to fight** while free of battle-shock, you may make a **psychic roll** of one D6 for it. If you do, a 1 battle-shocks this unit, and either way its melee attacks gain [[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits) and [[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic). The card does not say how long these weapon abilities last.",
